# Local self-contained data (embedded PostgreSQL + backups, rendered images, uploads)
# Ignore the whole runtime data dir, not just the default PGDATA_DIR. PGDATA_DIR
# is configurable, so a cluster left under any other name in data/ (e.g. from
# PGDATA_DIR=./data/pgdata-preview) was NOT ignored — that is a live database,
# thousands of binary files, one `git add .` away from a public repo.
data/
data/pgdata/
data/pg-credentials.json
.pglite
.pglite.*
public/storage/
.update-last-check
.update-status.json
.backups/
